   "body": "/claim mac/m4-captures\n\n- Private MP flows between the two kit accounts only, one request per minute (WRITE_CAPTURES private-only).\n- user2 creates `fixture-test-5` to user1, then user1 creates `fixture-test-6` to user2, so `fixture-test-5` is an unread row below row 1 in user1's list; user1's list before and after a user2 reply on it.\n- user2 (not the creator) replies on `fixture-test-6`; lists read as its creator (user1) and as user2.\n- Group conversation: a group needs members other than the two kit accounts, which this session may not write to: captured what the two accounts allow, the rest goes to the operator.\n- One draft PR `capture/610-mp-list-reply-order`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
