   "body": "Scope 2 of this issue (the same capture on a group conversation) cannot be done within this session's write rule: WRITE_CAPTURES is private-only, meaning the two kit accounts only. A group thread needs at least one member besides them (the earlier group captures `W70` and `W73` wrote to other members, under their own operator go). Scopes 1 and 3 are captured; the PR follows.\n\nOptions:\n- (a) Allow one group MP from user1 to user2 plus named consenting members, then a user2 reply and the lists.\n- (b) Reuse an existing group thread of the kit accounts. A reply there notifies its real members.\n- (c) Drop the group case: LOT-140 relies on the last post and the reply count, which this run shows are the same for any row.\n\nDecision needed (operator)\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
