   "body": "### Capture result\n\nPR #739 (`Refs #610`) holds `W610a`-`W610d` and `R610a`-`R610d`, captured 2026-11-10 with private MPs between the kit accounts.\n\n- **A reply moves an older row:** a reply lifts a lower row to the top of the MP list, because rows sort by last post. `fixture-test-5` went from row 3 to row 1, turned `closedbp.gif` \"Nouveau message\", got `[non lu]` and one reply.\n- **A reply by the non-creator:** a reply by the account that did not create the thread does the same in the creator's list.\n- **The replier's own list:** it shows its threads as \"Nouveau message\" too, so the icon does not tell who wrote last; the last poster does.\n- **What this changes:** HFR-PROTOCOL §6c LOT-140. LOT-140 should not rely on a row's position or its icon to detect a reply; the reply count and the last-post cell do. No merged code relies on the row staying in place, so I opened no follow-up issue.\n- **Still open:** scope 2 (group) waits for the decision asked above.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
